---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Originality Notice / 原创声明
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

《零环》(Zero Ring) is an original game. It only draws on the *genre* of
traditional turn-based roguelikes; it does NOT use the name, logo, art, UI,
icons, text, source code, or specific numeric values of Pathos or of any other
game. All graphics are generated procedurally by code
(scripts/generate-assets.ts); every class, monster, and item name, description,
and number is original to this project. No third-party or copyrighted image,
audio, font, or code asset is included in this repository.

《零环》为原创游戏，仅借鉴传统回合制 roguelike 的玩法类型，不包含 Pathos 或任何
其他游戏的名称、Logo、素材、UI、图标、文本、源代码或具体数值。所有图形均由代码
（scripts/generate-assets.ts）实时生成；职业、怪物、物品的名称、描述与数值均为本
项目原创；仓库内不含任何第三方或受版权保护的图片、音频、字体或代码素材。
